n\n==================================================\n13. SPECIAL FOCUS: GCE_DON\n==================================================\n\nClassify current top-level live surfaces under GCE_DON:\n\n- true Don operating floor\n- permanent project location\n- transitional legacy project location\n- live application/runtime\n- stale Framework copy\n- transport support\n- archive candidate\n\nDo NOT move EC8 or other active roots.\n\n==================================================\n14. EXPLICITLY EXCLUDE SESSION CONTROLLER\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT spend time on:\n\n- carousel UI\n- controller buttons\n- automatic seat advance\n- mobile approval UX\n- footer-to-button wiring\n- \"OPEN HANDOFF\" button\n- handoff-latest helper\n\nThose belong to later implementation work.\n\nYou MAY inspect routing metadata formats only where necessary to understand current state.\n\n==================================================\n15. REQUIRED OUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nReturn ONE CURRENT-STATE RECONCILIATION PACKAGE.\n\nA. EXECUTIVE CURRENT STATE\nIn plain English:\n- what is actually healthy\n- what is stale\n- what is dangerous\n- what changed since your previous pass\n\nB. CURRENT FROZEN ROSTER VS DISK\nTable:\n- seat\n- live?\n- bootstrap path\n- current?\n- stale refs?\n- routable?\n- action needed\n\nC. CANON / AUTHORITY MAP\nEvery current authority source:\n- path\n- claim\n- actual consumer\n- current/stale/conflicted\n\nD. ROUTING / BUS MAP\nAll active buses and their actual status.\n\nE. BOOTSTRAP AUDIT\nAll active seat bootstraps.\n\nF. PROJECT OWNERSHIP MAP\nWhere live project truth actually lives.\n\nG. IDENTITY POLLUTION STATE\nCause vs residue.\n\nH. CABLE CAR CURRENT STATE\n\nI. GCE_ORG CURRENT STATE\n\nJ. GCE_DON CURRENT STATE\n\nK. KEEP\nL. FIX NOW\nM. FIX LATER\nN. SUPERSEDE\nO. ARCHIVE\nP. UNKNOWN\n\nQ. DON / CODA DECISIONS ACTUALLY REQUIRED\nOnly real authority decisions.\nDo not escalate im