rther Cable Car schema/runtime hardening that Space Bunny/Nico surfaces in the taxonomy pass.", "text_chars": 2838, "code_blocks": 3, "links": ["https://docs.google.com/document/d/16qUbfOnqZmF50Jwpr5_Iba5nUm8k6_0TcoA5VbxLhls/edit?usp=drivesdk", "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dukgDM7RYbkNjmGkpDeyaH5dxxDteWcQtbqUp6_zm1k/edit?usp=drivesdk"], "citations": ["https://docs.google.com/document/d/16qUbfOnqZmF50Jwpr5_Iba5nUm8k6_0TcoA5VbxLhls/edit?usp=drivesdk", "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dukgDM7RYbkNjmGkpDeyaH5dxxDteWcQtbqUp6_zm1k/edit?usp=drivesdk"], "path_references": ["C:\\Users\\Dekan"], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "c603d257-210c-4329-b8e7-9ddc9773ffc5", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790382614.845237, "updated_at": 1790382642.99099, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Perfect. I'm about to drop in something from the other chat, but it was already mid-flight before we created this whole new taxonomy and process, right? Taxonomy we're cleaning up right now. But I want to drop something in because, again, you did it to me in another chat, saying you had it twice to try to use the cable car, then you freaked out and said, Just write the handoff. I copied it and pasted it to Space Bunny, and I was like, Why did you do that? You're like, I can't access Google Drive. Then I said you write artifacts all the time, and you said you're making this more complicated than it is. We need to get to the crux of this. It's probably because you're outside of the framework.", "text_chars": 699, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "5f005018-f4e3-4d04-b4cb-d627936e28e4", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790382617.581286, "updated_at":