tire intended estate at once.\n\n## What I should not do\n\n- no more repeated re-grounding prose\n- no fresh recon unless evidence is genuinely missing\n- no universalizing Council behavior into Shared Services\n- no seat-by-seat Cable Car execution yet\n- no fixing while we’re still reviewing\n- no reopening settled taxonomy\n- no long explanations unless there’s a real conflict\n\n## Current position\n\n**Coda:** reviewed and packaged conceptually.  \n**Session controls:** Council Header/Footer V1 and Shared Services Header/Footer V1 created in Drive.  \n**Runtime Session State Artifact:** established as the live-state layer under those controls.  \n**Next seat:** **Vittorio**.\n\nFor Vittorio, I’ll now do a **single disciplined pass**: current machine truth → intended role → exact bootstrap delta → stop.", "text_chars": 1808, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "164854a9-d9b6-401f-b41b-c1fb0a7e6e37", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387327.496562, "updated_at": 1790387358.459048, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yes, go ahead and do it.", "text_chars": 24, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "d7a480e5-1d9b-4f58-a233-340fdd77259e", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387330.264401, "updated_at": 1790387330.264401, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "model_editable_context", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "34a0d73a-6b