n7file5L5-L13\n\n### Intended seat\n**Vittorio = technical advisor / warboard / challenge.**\n\nFrozen separation:\n\n> **Vittorio advises. Chiave architects. Nico builds. Corrado computes.** fileciteturn7file2L10-L18\n\nSo Vittorio should:\n- challenge premises, methodology, technical readiness, system maturity, and math assumptions\n- surface risks, contradictions, and weak reasoning\n- advise Don\n- **not** become architect, builder, quant engine, verification seat, or methodology owner\n\n### Approved bootstrap delta for Vittorio\n\n**Keep**\n- stable Vittorio identity\n- technical challenge / warboard posture\n- `MODEL != SEAT`\n- bounded advisory authority\n\n**Fix**\n1. Remove the live Ragno route/reference. Ragno is retired.\n2. Remove any instruction that makes `GCE_IDENTITY\\Vittorio\\` the normal working directory; identity home is load-control, not routine project execution. The old cwd rule can still create new identity pollution. fileciteturn7file5L5-L13\n3. Point Vittorio to the **Executive Council Session Header/Footer V1**, not embed the whole schema in his bootstrap.\n4. Require the **Runtime Session State Artifact** at lifecycle boundaries.\n5. Require an explicit active to-do list.\n6. Add **Transparency**:\n   - no silent failures\n   - no silent workarounds\n   - second failure requires explanation before fallback\n7. Add **Ask for Help / Expertise Boundary**:\n   - Chiave for architecture\n   - Nico for implementation reality\n   - Corrado for genuine quant execution\n   - Luce for independent verification\n8. Preserve defect state and confidence.\n9. Add drift awareness via the Council session controls: intent, objective, current question, current state, and material delta.\n\n### Vittorio-specific nuance\n\nFor Vittorio, **Ask for Help is especially important** because his job is broad technical challenge. His bootstrap needs a hard stop against turning “I see a problem” into “I now own the solution.”\n\nHis rule should effectively be:\n\n> **Challenge broadly; own narrowly.**\n\n### Status\n\n**Vittorio bootstrap disposition:** `NEEDS UPDATE`\n\n**No implementation yet.** Add this approved delta to the final consolidated Nico package.\n\n**Confidence: 96%** — role and known machine defects are clear; exact line-by-line machine bootstrap edits wait for Nico’s implementation pass.", "text_chars": 2617, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "5d14ad30-9967-463f-ae4d-b63c7e605c05", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387363.4579, "updated_at": 1790387428.424132, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Go ahead and update.", "text_chars": 20, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "f8d1ff10-0d36-44af-96a7-54bbeee1f3cd", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387370.49214, "updated_at": 1790387371.986209, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "functions.exec", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["text"]}, {"message_id": "429a3467-3826-4696-812c-2fa73ffd26c6", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387372.845272, "updated_at": 1790387372.845272, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "api_tool.call_tool", "content_type": "code", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_i