ssion State Artifact use, to-do state, transparency, ask-for-help, cwd cleanup, retired-seat handling, drift awareness, confidence, and bounded sub-agent/swarm use.\n\nurlOpen Bootstrap Team Review Registerhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1P8iRyy5HQAIASZ-bu6xK5N3rKJKx1OZ0LajNr1AGf3M/edit?usp=drivesdk\n\nNo Nico pickup was released.", "text_chars": 963, "code_blocks": 0, "links": ["https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P8iRyy5HQAIASZ-bu6xK5N3rKJKx1OZ0LajNr1AGf3M/edit?usp=drivesdk"], "citations": ["https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P8iRyy5HQAIASZ-bu6xK5N3rKJKx1OZ0LajNr1AGf3M/edit?usp=drivesdk"], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "90def384-b5f9-451e-bd70-3986047e4e27", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387428.506298, "updated_at": 1790387443.706036, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Hey, I think you have enough by ingesting all the bootstraps to do a surgical one by one within a loop, so I could go for a walk and you could do it one by one. Please confirm the intent and objective.", "text_chars": 201, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "6ceebe86-97bc-4f6b-ade4-ae8d7e4969fa", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790387434.972546, "updated_at": 1790387443.362062, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yes. I have enough to do that **surgically, seat by seat, in a controlled loop**.\n\nYour intent is: while you go for a walk, I should use the already-ingested machine bootstrap recon plus the current Drive session/control artifacts to review the rest of the team **one seat at a time**, reconcile each seat against the current F